      "pack_commands": [
        {"id": "speckit_bash", "kind": "bash_script", "match": "^(?:(?:ba)?sh\\s+)?(?:\\./)?\\.specify/scripts/bash/[\\w.-]+\\.sh\\b", "path_globs": [".specify/scripts/bash/*.sh"]}
      ],
      "identifiers": ["Spec Kit", "spec-kit", "speckit", "Specify CLI", "specify init", "/speckit."],
      "bare_name_tokens": ["speckit"],
      "notes": "Layout of `specify init --ai agy --script sh` (Antigravity skills integration): command templates become .agents/skills/speckit-<name>/SKILL.md, templates and bash scripts go under .specify/, constitution template seeds .specify/memory/constitution.md. No always-on file: Spec Kit adds no context file for skills-based agents."
